---
title: "Herdr /restart: exact close, new incarnation, original input custody"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: Result
    lg1: Restart
    lg2: Breaks NoForeignClose
    lg3: Path to the NoForeignClose bug
  }
  class lg0 teal
  class lg1 blue
  class lg2 breaks
  class lg3 bugPath
  s0: Old session and original queued input
  s1: Restart excludes old input and captures exact pane
  s2: Reused numeric target was closed
  s3: Failure awaiting a visible result
  s4: Visible failure#59; originals remain owned
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: User /restart is accepted under transition and fence
  s1 --> s2: Reuse a numeric target after replacement
  s1 --> s3: Unknown or changed identity refuses close
  s3 --> s4: Show the failure and retain input custody
  classDef breaks fill:#ffecee,stroke:#e72e3b,stroke-width:2.5px,color:#cd2834
  class s0 blue
  class s0 bugPath
  class s1 blue
  class s1 bugPath
  class s2 breaks
  class s2 bugPath
  class s3 blue
  class s4 teal
